_meanings:
²1 To arise, proceed, spring up, to be born or produced, originate (with
 <ab>abl.</ab>); {#loBAt kroDaH praBavati#} <ls>H. 1. 25</ls>; {#svAyaMBuvAnmarIceryaH prabaBUva#}
 {#prajApatiH#} <ls>Ś. 7. 9</ls>; {#puruzaH prabaBUvAgnervismayena sahartvijAm#}
 <ls>R. 10. 50</ls>; {#avyaktAd vyaktayaH sarvAH praBavantyaharAgame#} <ls>Bg. 8. 18</ls>.
.²2 To appear, become visible; {#vane'pi dozAH praBavanti rAgiRAm#} <ls>H. 4. 84</ls>.
.²3 To multiply, increase; see {#praBUta#}.
.²4 To be strong or powerful, prevail, predominate, show oneʼs power; {#praBavati#}
 {#hi mahimnA svena yogISvarIyam#} <ls>Māl. 9. 52</ls>; {#praBavati BagavAn viDiH#} <ls>K.</ls>; <ls>Pt. 1. 44</ls>.
.²5 To be able or equal, have power for (with <ab>inf.</ab>) {#kusumAnyapi gAtrasaMgamAt#}
 {#praBavantyAyurapohituM yadi#} <ls>R. 8. 44</ls>; {#ko'nyo hutavahAddagDuM praBavizyati#}
 <ls>Ś. 4</ls>; <ls>Ś. 6. 30</ls>; <ls>V. 1. 9</ls>; <ls>U. 2. 4</ls>; <ls>Pt. 1</ls>.
.²5 To have control or power over, prevail over, be master of (usually
 with <ab>gen.</ab>, sometimes with <ab>dat.</ab> or <ab>loc.</ab>); {#yadi praBavizyAmyAtmanaH#} <ls>Ś. 1</ls>;
 {#praBavati nijasya kanyakAjanasya mahArAjaH#} <ls>Māl. 4</ls>; {#tat praBavati#}
 {#anuSAsane devI#} <ls>Ve. 2</ls>. {#viDirapi na#}

 {#yeByaH praBavati#} <ls>Bh. 2. 94</ls>; {#nfpatikulavataMsamAtmavaMSaM BuvamaDipallavitaM#}
 {#praBUya mene#} <ls>Śiva B. 1. 91</ls>.
.²7 To be a match for (with <ab>dat.</ab>); {#praBavati mallo mallAya#} <ls>Mbh.</ls>
.²8 To be sufficient for, be able to contain; {#api vyAptadigantAni nANgAni#}
