.²9 To be contained in (wit <ab>loc.</ab>); {#guruH praharzaH prabaBUva nAtmani#} <ls>R. 3. 17</ls>.
.²10 To be useful.
.²11 To implore, beseech.
.²12 To extend beyond, surpass (<ab>Ved.</ab>).
.²13 To profit, avail.
